{"path":"container/forward_list/push_front","title":"std::forward_list<T,Allocator>::push_front","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::forward_list&lt;T,Allocator&gt;::</span>push_front","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/container/forward_list/push_front","section":"container","kind":"page","summary":"Prepends the given element value to the beginning of the container.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx11\" id=\"Version_1\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw4\">void</span> push_front<span class=\"br0\">(</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span> T<span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> value <span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td> (1) </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx11\">(since C++11)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx11\" id=\"Version_2\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw4\">void</span> push_front<span class=\"br0\">(</span> T<span class=\"sy3\">&amp;&amp;</span> value <span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td> (2) </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx11\">(since C++11)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Prepends the given element <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">value</span></code> to the beginning of the container.\n</p><p>No iterators or references are invalidated.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Parameters\">Parameters</h3>\n<table class=\"t-par-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td> value\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td> the value of the element to prepend\n</td></tr></table>\n<h3 id=\"Return_value\">Return value</h3>\n<p>(none)\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Complexity\">Complexity</h3>\n<p>Constant.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Exceptions\">Exceptions</h3>\n<p>If an exception is thrown for any reason, these functions have no effect (<a href=\"/w/cpp/language/exceptions#Exception_safety\">strong exception safety guarantee</a>).\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<div class=\"t-example\">\n<pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;forward_list&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;iomanip&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;iostream&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;string&gt;</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw4\">int</span> main<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/container/forward_list\"><span class=\"kw1281\">std::<span class=\"me2\">forward_list</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/string/basic_string\"><span class=\"kw1238\">std::<span class=\"me2\">string</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span> letters<span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n    letters.<span class=\"me1\">push_front</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"st0\">\"abc\"</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/string/basic_string\"><span class=\"kw1238\">std::<span class=\"me2\">string</span></span></a> s<span class=\"br0\">{</span><span class=\"st0\">\"def\"</span><span class=\"br0\">}</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    letters.<span class=\"me1\">push_front</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span>std<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">move</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span>s<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"std::forward_list letters holds: \"</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"kw1\">for</span> <span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"kw4\">auto</span><span class=\"sy3\">&amp;&amp;</span> e <span class=\"sy4\">:</span> letters<span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n        <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/manip/quoted\"><span class=\"kw1819\">std::<span class=\"me2\">quoted</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span>e<span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">' '</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>Moved-from string s holds: \"</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/manip/quoted\"><span class=\"kw1819\">std::<span class=\"me2\">quoted</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span>s<span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">'<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>'</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span></code></pre>\n<p>Possible output:\n</p>\n<pre data-output=\"1\"><code>std::forward_list letters holds: \"def\" \"abc\"\nMoved-from string s holds: \"\"</code></pre> \n</div>\n<h3 id=\"See_also\">See also</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/container/forward_list/emplace_front\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>emplace_front</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  constructs an element in-place at the beginning <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/container/forward_list/pop_front\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>pop_front</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  removes the first element <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/iterator/front_inserter\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>front_inserter</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  creates a <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/iterator/front_insert_iterator\">std::front_insert_iterator</a></span> of type inferred from the argument <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(function template)</span> </td></tr>\n</table>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Parameters","id":"Parameters"},{"depth":3,"text":"Return value","id":"Return_value"},{"depth":3,"text":"Complexity","id":"Complexity"},{"depth":3,"text":"Exceptions","id":"Exceptions"},{"depth":3,"text":"Example","id":"Example"},{"depth":3,"text":"See also","id":"See_also"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"container","title":"Containers library"},{"path":"container/forward_list","title":"std::forward_list"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"std::forward_list<T,Allocator>::push_front","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"2 declarations; revisions: since C++11. Prepends the given element value to the beginning of the container."},{"label":"Parameters","note":"value"},{"label":"Return value","note":"(none)"},{"label":"Complexity","note":"Constant."},{"label":"Exceptions","note":"If an exception is thrown for any reason, these functions have no effect (strong exception safety guarantee)."},{"label":"Example"},{"label":"See also","children":[{"label":"emplace_front","note":"constructs an element in-place at the beginning"},{"label":"pop_front","note":"removes the first element"},{"label":"front_inserter","note":"creates a std::front_insert_iterator of type inferred from the argument"}]}]},"standards":["C++11"],"wordCount":159,"codeBlockCount":2}
